& [TandemOpening] establishes exact identity and bounded progress
  + a clean Opened capsule must name the supplied declared intent and current repository and plan revisions
  + every opening contains unique prospective and retrospective cursors, exact work-packet coordinates, a closed barrier, and optional authority-bound execution cursor
  + prospective work is mandatory and execution work is mandatory when an execution lane exists
  + every runtime transition kind has caller-supplied count-bounded lag-policy coverage
  + opening validates the complete candidate CTPR graph before returning a successor

& [CapsuleAndLaneLifecycle] preserves evidence
  + the canonical CTPR capsule and lane transition tables are the only accepted state edges
  + task, plan, repository, capsule, intent, lane kind, authority, dependency, message, and prior evidence coordinates cannot be silently replaced or removed
  + Prepared, ExecutionRequested, EffectObserved, ReflectionReturned, and reconciled states require their state-specific evidence
  + prospective lanes return only the prepared candidate, execution lanes only the supplied simulated outcome, and retrospective lanes only their exact ReflectionReturn
  + timeout names a logical timeout record and terminal crash reentry creates a new prepared cursor with its exact predecessor dependency

& [MessagesObserverAndBarrier] derive completeness
  + lane messages are immutable, same-capsule, named-sender and named-receiver records at the current logical tick
  + every new message cites the sender's previous message and only already-present causal predecessors
  + required acknowledgment is accepted only from the exact receiver and retained in the runtime root
  + lane-to-return bindings are runtime state; Observer expected and received sets must equal the derived complete return set
  + every lane must settle, abnormal terminal lanes require residual accounting, and every required message must be acknowledged
  + Observer rechecks current repository, current plan, capsule, task, materiality policy, lag policy, authority, stale checks, reflection identity, and monotonic capsule evidence
  + a release barrier opens only for its exact dependency and return sets under an Observer Admit or Qualify disposition that names the barrier

& [DeterministicRootAndFaultBoundary] is reconstructable
  + capsule and lane histories begin at their runtime opening or reentry state and every adjacent edge validates
  + return bindings, acknowledgments, reentry predecessors, and per-capsule transition counts are root-digest-bound
  + accepted operations produce immutable successors and receipts; every refusal preserves the prior snapshot
  + transition, stale-predecessor, missing-reference, invalid-form, invalid-reentry, duplicate, and bound faults remain typed and inspectable

& [DeliberateLimits] are binding
  + execution outcomes are inert caller-supplied fixture references and no tool or effect is invoked
  + logical timeout is a supplied transition and no timer, sleep, thread, or lease process exists
  + residual text is explicit but this slice does not infer or repair a residual
  + no persistence, filesystem, Git, network, database service, provider, model, process procedure, compiler fixture, FPGA, or hardware behavior is added

